  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic Engagement Alliance (CEA) in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Civic Engagement Alliance Kenya focuses lobbying and advocating for  policies and regulations that promote civic space for CSOs, food security and nutrition and inclusive markets for Soya, sorghum, maize and poultry. It is being being implemented with in  5 national NGOs that include KCDF, AYT, KAACR, AICCAD and ADS-W. The programme is implemented in 5 counties which include Kisumu, Busia, Kakamega, Bungoma and Homa Bay.</narrative>
  </description>
